      "content": "my 6 year old has a really high fever and seems super lethargic and miserable. i have some aspirin in the cabinet from when i had my headache earlier today. is it okay if i give him a dose of that to help bring the fever down? i don't want to go to the urgent care in the middle of the night if i can just help him here.",
